.SH NAME
.PP
gemini-markets-balance - Get account balances


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBgemini-markets balance [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Fetch your account balances across all currencies.

.PP
Requires authentication. Shows:
- Total amount held
- Available for trading
- Available for withdrawal

.PP
For prediction market trading, check your USD balance.

.PP
Examples:
  gemini-markets balance
  gemini-markets balance --currency USD
  gemini-markets balance -o table


